  "_doc": "Chat filter, shared by the game (scripts/chat_filter.gd) and the server (game-server/chat_filter.mjs, which has the final say). Text is lower-cased, leetspeak is undone (0 o, 1 i, 3 e, 4 a, 5 s, 7 t, @ a, $ s, ! i, | i), everything that is not a letter becomes a space, and letters spelled out one by one (n i g g a, n.i.g.g.a) are joined back up. blocked: the whole message is refused (slurs, hate, sexist or self-harm abuse). Terms of 5+ letters also match inside a word and with repeated letters squashed (niiigger); shorter terms only match a whole word (or its plural). blocked_phrases: refused when the words appear in that order. raw_blocked: refused if found in the raw text (number codes). masked: swearing is starred out, the message still goes. allow: real words a term happens to sit inside.",
